# [[ .Name ]]

A quan. It cannot run on its own: a quanar loads it and gives it a place to live.
Everything it needs from the outside comes through its qua.
[[ if not .Quas ]]
> **No qua yet.** Add a qua to `package.json`, list it in `vite.config.ts` next
> to React with the global its quanar shares it on, and type the manifest in
> `src/index.ts` with the qua's `QuanManifest`.
[[ end ]]
- `src/index.ts` is the manifest: name, version, routes and permissions.
- `src/pages` holds the pages the manifest routes to.

```sh
npm run watch    # builds the quan and serves it on port [[ .Port ]] for the quanar
```
